142     number is parsed thusly: Version (say) 5.1/6 is major version 5,
142     release 1, bugfix 6.  The release number is changed only when the
142     cave mapping is altered or when new items are added.  The major
142     version number is incremented after adding extensions large enough
142     to affect the overall flavor of the game.  To whet curious appetites,
